esults","featureDescription1":"With our powerful AI technology, the whole upscaling process is completed within few seconds","featureTitle2":"Increase Resolution","featureDescription2":"Using our advanced computer vision algorithms, you can  increase the resolution up to 4x","featureTitle3":"Retain Details","featureDescription3":"We maintain textures from your image and enhance them in a way that they look realistic when the image is upscaled","ctaText":"Upload Image"},"features":{"mainTitle":"Upscale.media is for Everyone","mainDescription":"Utilise our AI image enhancer to upscale images, increasing resolution while preserving quality for your personal and business needs.","featureTitle1":"Professionals","featureDescription1_1":"Easily enhance low-quality images to save time for other creative tasks","featureDescription1_2":"Upscale anything from paintings to digital art, from portraits to landscapes, from logos to product catalogue images","featureBtnText1":"Upload Image","featureTitle2":"E-commerce","featureDescription2_1":"Increase conversion rates of your products online with sharp and clear images","featureDescription2_2":"Streamline your workflow by handling high-resolution requirements of different platforms using Upscale.media","featureBtnText2":"Upload Image","featureTitle3":"Individuals","featureDescription3_1":"Upscale your compressed images from social media by up to 400%","featureDescription3_2":"Enhancement was never this easy, but with the help of AI, it can be done in a few seconds without spending on expensive tools","featureBtnText3":"Upload Image"},"faqs":{"title":"<span>Frequently</span> Asked Questions","description":"Here, we have listed some of the commonly asked questions from the community. If you do not find the information you need, feel free to reach out to us at <a {{pixelbinSupportTag}}>support@pixelbin.io</a>","step":"Step","faqslist":[{"answer":"Upscale.media is a platform that serves as an AI image enhancer, enabling users to upscale images while maintaining superior quality. Its advanced technology effortlessly enhances visuals, making it an ideal solution for individuals and businesses seeking high-quality image upscaling.","question":"What is Upscale.media?"},{"answer":"<strong>Yes</strong>, with Upscale.media, you can enhance and upscale your low-quality images for free online. It only takes a few seconds to do so. <a {{pixelbinAnchorTag}}>PixelBin.io</a> provides various subscription plans for commercial or professional use.","question":"Is Upscale.media free Online AI Photo Enhancer?"},{"answer":"Upscale.media now supports the image types <strong>PNG, JPG, JPEG, WEBP, and HEIC</strong>.","question":"What images are supported?"},{"answer":"You can batch process your images using our product <a {{pixelbinAnchorTag}}>PixelBin.io</a>. PixelBin offers real-time image transformations with automatic optimization, image URLs, and storage for your media library.","question":"How can I use Upscale.media for bulk processing or commercial purposes?"},{"answer":"The maximum output resolution and size supported is <strong>{{maxUpscaleDimension}} x {{maxUpscaleDimension}} px</strong> and <strong>25 MB</strong>.","question":"What is the maximum image resolution / file size?"},{"answer":"It is now easier to enhance the image quality online in bulk using PixelBin.io, where you get a first few transformations for free and rest you can avail by buying credits as per your requirements. You can also contact the customer service team for your custom package that fits the needs of your enterprise.","question":"Can I process the Images on Bulk with Upscale.media?"},{"answer":{"steps":["Download the Upscale.media’s app from the AppStore or PlayStore or go to the website and upload the image you wish to increase the image quality by clicking on the Upload Image option or simply using the Drag-and-Drop feature. ","Hang tight for a few seconds, as a free AI photo enhancer enhances your image\'s photo resolution.","Once your image is processed, you can choose to upscale it by 2X, 4X, or 8X using AI. Signed-up users can upscale images to a maximum resolution of {{maxUpscaleDimension}} x {{maxUpscaleDimension}} px, while non-logged-in users are limited to {{maxResolutionLimitDimension}} x {{maxResolutionLimitDimension}} px.","Download the image by clicking the Download Image option."],"value":"Using Upscale.media You can upscale an image within a few seconds without applying technical skills. Here is how to do so: "},"question":"How can I Upscale an image using Upscale.media?"},{"answer":"Upscale.media is the best AI photo enhancer (AI image enlarger), utilising cutting-edge technology to upscale images while preserving exceptional quality and clarity. It is the top choice for enhancing photographs with AI.","question":"Which is the best AI photo enhancer?"},{"answer":"For commercial purposes, Upscale.media stands out as the best AI image enlarger. Its advanced AI algorithms ensure exceptional image enlargement while maintaining top-notch quality, making it the ideal choice for businesses seeking professional-grade upscaled images.","question":"Which is the best AI image enlarger for commercial purposes?"},{"answer":{"steps":["Visit Upscale.media website or download it on your Android or Ios device","Click on the \\"Upload Image\\" option or use the convenient Drag-and-Drop feature to upload your image.","Wait a few seconds as the free AI photo enhancer enhances your image\'s resolution.","Choose from the available upscaling options: 2X, 4X or 8X and click \'Enhance Quality\'. Then download your enhanced image. Logged-in users can upscale up to {{maxUpscaleDimension}} x {{maxUpscaleDimension}} px, while non-logged-in users are limited to {{maxResolutionLimitDimension}} x {{maxResolutionLimitDimension}} px."],"value":"To increase image quality online, follow these simple steps:"},"question":"How to increase image quality online?"}]},"demo":{"title":"Looking for plans beyond <span class=\'linear-gradient\'>5000 credits</span>?","mainDesc":"We are here for you! Book a slot at your convenience and leave the rest to us:","text":"Here’s what we offer for your enterprise\'s growth:","points":[{"point":"Personalized Quote"},{"point":"1:1 Consultations"},{"point":"Product Demo"},{"point":"Email Support"}],"connectBtnText":"Connect with us Today"},"aboutUpscale":{"title":"Upscale and Enhance your Images Online with Upscale.media","description":"Do you wish to convert your low-quality image to a high-quality one? Well, enhance your images with Upscale.media’s AI image upscaler.","step":"","content":[{"title":"","description":["Enhance photo quality with Upscale.media\'s AI image resolution enhancer converts low-quality images into high-definition masterpieces in seconds. Effortlessly upscale images and improve the resolution of your images automatically online using Upscale.media."]},{"title":"Upscale and Enhance Image Quality","description":["Upscale.media helps you make the most out of state-of-the-art technology that helps in clarifying, enhancing, sharpening, and upscaling your image quality for free online. With Upscale.media’s AI Image Upscaler, you get stunning photos that are of high quality."]},{"title":"Increase Image Resolution in Bulk","description":["Upscalling of photos are possibile by Pixelbin.io offers bulk image upscaling, allowing you to enhance multiple images quickly and easily. Simply upload your images, select your desired resolution, and download the upscaled versions. It\'s that easy!"]},{"title":"Enhance Image Quality Of PNG, JPEG, JPG, WebP And HEIC Images","description":["Using Upscale.media’s AI, you can upscale the image resolution from PNG, JPEG, JPG, WebP and HEIC images in no time. The AI is well equipped to upscale and enhance images for free online."]},{"title":"Increase Resolution upto 4 Times","description":["Experience the ultimate transformation with Upscale.media, an AI-powered photo enhancer online free, offering seamless ways to enhance photo quality and increase image resolution by up to 4 times, elevating your visuals to a whole new level of excellence."]},{"title":"Get Rid Of JPEG Artifacts in a few seconds","description":["When you edit and save your image multiple times, it becomes pixelated. The process is called artefacts, making your image look like it is of poor quality. Thanks to the powerful Upscale.media’s AI that aids in improving image quality."]},{"steps":["<b>Upload The Image</b> – Download the Upscale.media app from AppStore or PlayStore, or go to the website and upload the image you wish to upscale the quality of by clicking on the Upload Image option. You can enhance the image quality online for free from a JPG, JPEG, PNG, WebP or HEIC image.","<b>Wait For A Few Seconds</b> – As and when your image gets uploaded, the AI starts working on increasing the image resolution. It might take up a few seconds.","<b>Pick The Image Resolution</b> – Once processing is complete, you can choose to upscale your image by 2X, 4X, or 8X using AI. Signed-up users can upscale up to {{maxUpscaleDimension}} x {{maxUpscaleDimension}} px, while non-logged-in users are limited to {{maxResolutionLimitDimension}} x {{maxResolutionLimitDimension}} px.","<b>Save The Image</b> - Now that you have your upscaled and enhanced image, click Download to save the image."],"title":"How Can You Upscale Image Online With Upscale.media?","description":"Upscale.media is an advanced AI-based online image upscaler that is easy to use and does the job quickly. Here’s how you can enhance your image quality online using Upscale.media:"}],"readMore":"Read More","readLess":"Read Less"},"enterprise":{"title":"Enterprise Solutions at Scale","mainDesc":"Enhance your business performance and overall growth using our robust solutions","bulkTitle":"Bulk Transformation","bulkInfo":"No more switching back and forth to transform images. Experience bulk image enhancement on a single platform by uploading multiple images in one go.","integrationTitle":"Seamless API Integration","integrationInfo":"Speed up your workflows and enhance productivity by seamlessly integrating our APIs into your existing organization."},"moreToolsCMSContent":{"title":"More Tools","tools":[{"id":"sharpen-image","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_1.png","title":"Sharpen Image","prompt":"Enhance the uploaded image by increasing brightness and overall clarity while preserving natural colors, skin tones, and original details. Improve lighting balance, reduce dullness and shadows, and bring out hidden details without overexposing highlights or washing out the image. Ensure the final output looks realistic, sharp, and high-quality, with no color distortion, noise, or artificial effects, while maintaining the original structure and texture of the photo.","description":"Enhance edge definition to make photos look crisp and focused"},{"id":"retouch-photo","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_2.png","title":"Retouch Photo","prompt":"Remove dust from the uploaded image and restore natural clarity. Unblur all blurred areas including text, face, body, objects, or background if present. Enhance sharpness, focus, and readability while preserving original identity, proportions, and details. If text is present, make it clearly readable without altering content. If a face or human body is present, restore clarity naturally without changing facial features or appearance. Maintain realistic textures, lighting, colors, and overall authenticity. Avoid over-sharpening, artificial details, hallucinated content, or visual distortion","description":"Polish textures and details for a smooth, refined finish"},{"id":"enhance-face","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_3.png","title":"Enhance Face","prompt":"Restore image clarity by removing blur, distortion, and noise. Reconstruct lost details, sharpen edges, and enhance fine textures. If the image is heavily blurred or distorted, correct it to a clear and natural appearance. Upscale resolution without preserving blur or unwanted visual effects. Maintain original colors, lighting, and realistic structure. Avoid artifacts, over-sharpening, or artificial enhancements","description":"Revive portraits by brightening and smoothing facial features"},{"id":"deblur-image","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_4.png","title":"Deblur Image","prompt":"Remove blur from the uploaded image and restore natural clarity. Unblur all blurred areas including text, face, body, objects, or background if present. Enhance sharpness, focus, and readability while preserving original identity, proportions, and details. If text is present, make it clearly readable without altering content. If a face or human body is present, restore clarity naturally without changing facial features or appearance. Maintain realistic textures, lighting, colors, and overall authenticity. Avoid over-sharpening, artificial details, hallucinated content, or visual distortion","description":"Eliminate blur to bring back natural sharpness"},{"id":"dehaze-image","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_5.png","title":"Dehaze Image","prompt":"Remove haze and fog from the uploaded image. Improve clarity, contrast, and visibility while preserving natural colors, lighting, and details. Maintain a realistic and clean look without over-processing.","description":"Remove haze and improve contrast for clearer, vivid visuals"},{"id":"remove-motion-blur","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_6.png","title":"Remove Motion Blur","prompt":"Remove motion blur from the uploaded image. Restore sharpness and clarity while preserving original colors, textures, and details. Maintain a natural look without over-sharpening or artifacts. High-quality realistic result.","description":"Correct camera shake for a steady, well-defined image"},{"id":"restore-image","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_7.png","title":"Restore Image","prompt":"Restore the uploaded image by repairing damage, improving clarity, and enhancing details. Remove noise, scratches, blur, and compression artifacts. Preserve original colors, textures, and composition. Produce a clean, natural, high-quality restored image.","description":"Repair aged or damaged photos and recover lost details"},{"id":"colourise-image","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_8.png","title":"Colourise Image","prompt":"Colorize the uploaded black and white image with natural and realistic colors. Preserve original details, textures, and lighting. Apply accurate skin tones, clothing colors, and background colors. Maintain a clean, realistic, high-quality photo look.","description":"Add realistic colours to black-and-white or faded photos"},{"id":"face-restoration","image":"https://cdn.pixelbin.io/v2/dummy-cloudname/original/upscalemedia_assets/Enhance_With_AI/enhance_9.png","title":"Face Restoration","prompt":"Restore the face in the uploaded image with ultra high-quality enhancement. Strong identity preservation, realistic skin texture, clear eyes, reduced blur and noise, professional portrait-quality result.","description":"Rebuild facial features with enhanced sharpness and tone"}]}}')}},e={},a,r,n,c;function i(a){var r=e[a];if(void 0!==r)return r.exports;var n=e[a]={id:a,loaded:!1,exports:{}};return t[a].call(n.exports,n,n.exports,i),n.loaded=!0,n.exports}i.m=t,i.amdO={},i.n=t=>{var e=t&&t.__esModule?()=>t.default:()=>t;return i.d(e,{a:e}),e},r=Object.getPrototypeOf?t=>Object.getPrototypeOf(t):t